📊 Retail Sales Analysis

📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing retail sales data using Microsoft Excel and Power BI to understand sales performance and identify useful business insights.

The project includes data analysis, KPI calculations, and an interactive Power BI dashboard.

🎯 Objectives

- Analyze overall sales performance
- Understand product performance
- Identify sales trends
- Analyze key business KPIs
- Present insights through an interactive dashboard

🛠️ Tools & Technologies

- Microsoft Excel
- Microsoft Power BI
- Data Analysis
- Data Visualization

 📈 Dashboard

The interactive Power BI dashboard presents key sales performance metrics and visualizations.

![Retail Sales Dashboard](Dashboard.png.png)

 🔍 Key Areas Analyzed

- Sales
- Quantity
- Profit
- Orders
- Product performance
- Sales trends

💡 Key Insights

The analysis helps understand sales performance, product-level performance, and important patterns in the retail sales data.

📁 Project Files

- Excel dataset
- Power BI dashboard
- Dashboard screenshot
- Project report

🚀 Project Outcome

This project helped me gain practical experience in data cleaning, analysis, KPI creation, dashboard development, and presenting data-driven insights using Excel and Power BI.
